From bb91ddd9b4bd3a5401a41365888abdc4dc05c6af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: KnutMann <knutmann@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 21:35:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/39] Adium adaptations: reactions, inline media, voice
 decode, names

- Message cache: default size 100 (was 0, so reactions never resolved)
  and persist after every addition to survive unclean shutdowns
- Send image/png as a proper image message (was document)
- Default attachment handling to inline display; voice notes are
  decoded from Ogg/Opus to WAV (new opusfile_decode_file_to_wav) and
  handed to the UI as a playable link
- File transfers use the original file name when present
- Group JIDs surfacing as buddies via transfer attribution inherit the
  group's name from the blist chat entry
- Echo sent images into the chat after a successful outgoing transfer
- Group name feed and participant alias resolution (earlier work)
- CMake: link static opusfile with its ogg/opus dependencies

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
