From 3200a4b21f6b8a6420287d8925d6e041558b0e93 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: KnutMann <knutmann@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 16:35:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 11/39] Resolve WhatsApp business account names

Business accounts often carry no push name; whatsmeow delivers their verified
name instead, both as a field on every message and as a BusinessName event when
the cached value changes. Handle the event by updating the buddy alias, and let
the verified name stand in for the push name on the message path, so a business
contact shows its name instead of its bare JID.
---
