com.apple.quarantine on disk: a received document double-clicked in Finder
opened without Gatekeeper ever interposing, unlike the same file saved by a
browser. Every path that lands a file - the Downloads document, the transfer
mechanism, the templated destination, the temporary media files - now stamps
it through the supported Foundation API, so the record's format stays whatever
the system says it is; verified on disk, the attribute reads exactly like a
browser's, agent "Adium", timestamp and identifier filled in by the system.

